      "content": "redefining things doesn't change the fact that i'm the one who made it. i'm the architect of this mess. i keep trying to find some way to just... exist without the weight, but the walls just feel closer every day. it's like there's no version of the future where this stops feeling so heavy. it just feels like a dead end.",
